Z||000003||samoht||08-24-2001||08:12 PM||||i have an accel, I tried to cut down an allen wrench , but you still couldnt turn it far enough, so I glue a peice od an allen wrench in the and use a long open end wrench that is off set... best bet is to do your reseach and set it b4 you put the top back on the intake.  I run about 42 psi at idle in my 3.2 .. hope that helps||||reg||1
